Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:17:20 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 130/165] dt-bindings: phy: qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy: Add
 Kaanapali CSI2 PHY

The Kaanapali CSI2 PHY is compatible with the existing x1e80100 CSI2
C-PHY/DPHY binding. Add the "qcom,kaanapali-csi2-phy" compatible.

Reviewed-by: Bryan O'Donoghue <bryan.odonoghue@linaro.org>
Acked-by: Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzysztof.kozlowski@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://patchwork.kernel.org/series/1192881/ (v22)
(cherry picked from commit aa86cf6800088f311270fb9b08732dc610d3e2d1)
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml       | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml
index 1f1e2a4993b2..6e9eb8e265df 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml
@@ -17,7 +17,9 @@ description:
 properties:
   compatible:
     oneOf:
-      - const: qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy
+      - enum:
+          - qcom,kaanapali-csi2-phy
+          - qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy
       - items:
           - const: qcom,glymur-csi2-phy
           - const: qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy
